  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "uid": "3afb493bbe5be5a2e46336b04a777791",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "type": "dlg.say",
      "data": {
        "actor": {
          "guid": "39b693b4900b4004c9df5f98131a8cfe",
          "name": "Luna1"
        },
        "text": {
          "ru": "Должна была попасть в Луну. Прошла мимо примерно в шести тысячах километров и стала первым рукотворным предметом на орбите вокруг Солнца.",
          "en": "It was meant to strike the Moon. It passed about six thousand kilometres away and became the first man-made object in orbit around the Sun."
        }
      },
      "out": [
        {
          "uid": "b12a437b3d38757c97315b1c6d155953",
          "target": "a0cfb3df741462443d927e86aa9609bf"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "a0cfb3df741462443d927e86aa9609bf",
      "position": [
        0,
        140
      ],
      "type": "dlg.say",
      "data": {
        "actor": {
          "guid": "39b693b4900b4004c9df5f98131a8cfe",
          "name": "Luna1"
        },
        "text": {
          "ru": "По пути выпустила килограмм натрия: облако наблюдали с Земли как оранжевую комету.",
          "en": "On the way it released a kilogram of sodium: the cloud was observed from Earth as an orange comet."
        }
      },
      "out": [
        {
          "uid": "15959cc405fd8513e72aa57fe5cd7b59",
          "target": "e9b74365f975a5588590766a607224e0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "e9b74365f975a5588590766a607224e0",
      "position": [
        0,
        280
      ],
      "type": "dlg.say",
      "data": {
        "actor": {
          "guid": "39b693b4900b4004c9df5f98131a8cfe",
          "name": "Luna1"
        },
        "text": {
          "ru": "Первой прямо измерила солнечный ветер и установила, что у Луны нет заметного магнитного поля.",
          "en": "It made the first direct measurement of the solar wind and established that the Moon has no appreciable magnetic field."
        }
      },
      "out": [
        {
          "uid": "6b78325b50bf6e040b9dddf5e310052d",
          "target": "47ea3a8a9827cedaea2d81ad748040b9"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "47ea3a8a9827cedaea2d81ad748040b9",
      "position": [
        0,
        420
      ],
      "type": "dlg.finish",
      "data": {
        "success": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
